{"title": "Cap of Curing", "pageid": 3452, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Cap_of_Curing", "categories": ["Helmets", "Uncommon items", "Bard set", "Healing set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cap_of_Curing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Cap_of_Curing_Icon.png/300px-Cap_of_Curing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/f6/Cap_of_Curing_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Cap of Curing image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Cap_of_Curing_Icon.png/300px-Cap_of_Curing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Cap_of_Curing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Cap of Curing</span></a> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Headwear\" title=\"Headwear\">Hat</a> that heals those inspired by the wearer using <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\">Bardic Inspiration</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Putting on this hat is somehow enough to lift your spirits.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" title=\"Helmets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/38px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/50px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helmets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Helmets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Journal Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_consumable_by_Gale\" title=\"List of Items consumable by Gale\">Consumable</a> by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 90 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  90  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Bard_HealingBardicInspiration_Hat</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Bard_HealingBardicInspiration_Hat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Bard_HealingBardicInspiration_Hat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">cfbd013c-f24d-4430-be13-d7bfafd48709</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cfbd013c-f24d-4430-be13-d7bfafd48709\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cfbd013c-f24d-4430-be13-d7bfafd48709\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Bard_HealingBardicInspiration_Hat</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Bard_HealingBardicInspiration_Hat+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Bard_HealingBardicInspiration_Hat+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Soothing_Songs\" title=\"Soothing Songs\">Soothing Songs</a></dt><dd>When you inspire an ally using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/38px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/50px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bardic Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\">Bardic Inspiration</a>, they also regain <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Sacred_Pool\" title=\"Sacred Pool\">Sacred Pool</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;289&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;488</span>: In a locked gilded chest behind a pillar near to where <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/38px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/50px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alfira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\">Alfira</a> is composing her song in the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Soothing Songs:</i></p>\n<ul><li>When a creature is healed by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/20px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/30px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/40px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bardic Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/20px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\">Bardic Inspiration</a>, the game does not equate this with the wearer of the Cap of Curing directly healing the creature. As such, it does not trigger effects like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blessed_Mercy\" title=\"Blessed Mercy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blessed Mercy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blessed_Mercy\" title=\"Blessed Mercy\">Blessed Mercy</a> from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Whispering_Promise\" title=\"The Whispering Promise\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Whispering_Promise\" title=\"The Whispering Promise\">The Whispering Promise</a>.</li>\n<li>The healing occurs when Bardic Inspiration is given to a creature, not when they actually use it.</li>\n<li>This effect is only triggered by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/20px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/30px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/40px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bardic Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/20px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\">Bardic Inspiration</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Inspiration\" title=\"Combat Inspiration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/20px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/30px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/40px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Combat Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/20px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Inspiration\" title=\"Combat Inspiration\">Combat Inspiration</a>. The special <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/20px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/30px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/40px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/20px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration (class action)\">Improved Bardic Inspiration</a> granted by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/38px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/50px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alfira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\">Alfira</a> does not trigger the healing, nor does <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mantle_of_Inspiration\" title=\"Mantle of Inspiration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Mantle_of_Inspiration_Icon.webp/20px-Mantle_of_Inspiration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Mantle_of_I